# Every entry carries an exp: date so CI fails again after expiry and forces a re-check
# (remove the entry if Debian has shipped a fix; otherwise extend it with a fresh rationale).
# Audited 2026-09-26 (POV-206): the seven older libexpat/libuuid entries without exp: were no
# longer reported for the image (fresh --pull base, Debian 13.7) and have been removed.

# --- Added 2026-09-25 (POV-207). Status "affected" in Debian 13, no fixed package yet. ---
